      "location": 2,
      "content": "所以你弹得非常快"
    },
    {
      "from": 312.67,
      "to": 315.01,
      "sid": 122,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "然后你判断你离目标有多远"
    },
    {
      "from": 315.01,
      "to": 316.559,
      "sid": 123,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "你可能是对的"
    },
    {
      "from": 316.559,
      "to": 318.71,
